<title>LATVIA: All Latvian T-bill yields below 9 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>All Latvian T-bill yields below 9 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>All yields fell again at an auction of Latvian Treasury bills on Wednesday, going below nine percent, the finance ministry said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of lats. There was no auction of one-year paper.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AVG YLD (pct)    AVG LAST WEEK  ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> One month    7.95		 9.22	   1.20  3.33  1.20</p>
<p> Three month  8.70		 9.44	   1.30  5.93  1.30</p>
<p> Six month    8.71		 9.60	   1.50  7.37  1.50</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
